# Line endings.
#
# This repository is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true and built on
# ubuntu-latest in CI, so any file whose *bytes* are compared has to be pinned or
# the two disagree. photo-manifest.json is generated by
# preview/scripts/derive-photos.mjs and checked against its own regeneration by
# `npm run photos:check`; stored LF and checked out CRLF, that check reported
# every photograph as stale on a fresh clone.
#
# The script normalises line endings before comparing as well — this is the
# belt, that is the braces.
*.json text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# Photographs and their derived ladder: never touched by line-ending conversion.
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
